{"text": "Then a low, dull, quick sound. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Reached my ears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like a watch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Wrapped in cotton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I knew that sound too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the beating. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of the old mans heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It grew quicker and quicker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And louder and louder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old mans terror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Must have been extreme. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A new fear seized me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The sound would be heard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By a neighbor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a loud yell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I threw open the lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And jumped into the room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He cried once, only once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then the room was silent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man was dead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And his eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would trouble me no more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next I worked quickly but silently. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To hide the body. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I took up three boards. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And placed him under them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I put the boards back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So cleverly that no human eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Could have found anything wrong.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "w", ",", " ", "d", "u", "l", "l", ",", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", " ", "s", "o", "u", "n", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "R", "e", "a", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "m", "y", " ", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "w", "a", "t", "c",